Modifications by anolilab and contributors:
  - The Node-only `node:crypto` `createHash("sha256")` backend was replaced
    with a portable, synchronous, dependency-free SHA-256 (`src/sha256.ts`)
    so the package runs unchanged on the browser, the Cloudflare Workers
    (workerd) runtime, and Node. The canonical string and resulting hash are
    byte-for-byte identical.
  - A Lunora-specific adapter (`src/lunora.ts`, `fingerprintError`) was added
    on top of the vendored core.

